 is said a hundred dimensions exist, some large others small.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/670750/extras/0n0w_2021_7.png?t=1742403694\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Intertwined by a legion of doors with wayward intentions.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/670750/extras/0n0w_2021_2.png?t=1742403694\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">You can check out any time you like, but you can never leave</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/670750/extras/0n0w_2021_4.png?t=1742403694\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">There's nothing to fight or be surprised by (except the gorgeous looks), and is suitable for all ages and states of mind :)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Made by one folk and first ever project so expect some lovely jank here and there &lt;3</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Photosensitive epileptic seizures warning! A percentage of people may experience a seizure when exposed to certain visual images, including flashing lights or patterns that appear in videogames such as this, please do refrain from use if susceptible, this game's an explosion for the eyes!</i></p></li></ul>","developers":["Colorfiction"],"dlc":[830570,835140],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/670750/7d976fad872d1ae7ebee0f45d0546a5623d259e3/header.jpg?t=1742403694","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"0\